| CI・証明・実測 | [LINK: DOC-VERIFICATION-CI-CD, CI/CD]（実行・認定）・[LINK: DOC-VERIFICATION-TEST-ARCHITECTURE-OPTIMIZATION, Test architecture]（証明配置）・[LINK: DOC-VERIFICATION-E2E-EXECUTION, E2E execution]（Browser実行最適化の詳細。上位契約を置換しない） |
